## Overview

Grand Theft Auto VI is available in Standard and Ultimate Editions.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Standard Edition

The Standard Edition includes the game.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The Standard Edition’s listed US price is $79.99.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Ultimate Edition

The Ultimate Edition contains Grand Theft Auto VI and the Ultimate Edition Upgrade.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The Ultimate Edition bundles an exclusive collection of premium vehicles, weapons, apparel, and action threaded across Jason and Lucia’s story.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} The Ultimate Edition’s listed US price is $99.99.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Ultimate Edition Upgrade

An Ultimate Edition Upgrade can be purchased separately for Standard Edition owners at any time.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Physical Standard Edition buyers can upgrade after their digital download code has been redeemed.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

