## When pre-orders opened

Rockstar opened Grand Theft Auto VI pre-orders starting at midnight local time on June 25, 2026.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Where to pre-order

Rockstar listed the PlayStation Store, Microsoft Store, Rockstar Games Store, and global retailers as places to buy pre-orders.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Grand Theft Auto VI was available in both digital and physical versions for pre-order.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Pre-order bonuses and timing

All pre-orders and purchases made prior to November 20, 2026 received the Vintage Vice City Pack.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Digital pre-orders and purchases prior to November 20, 2026 included one month of GTA+.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} PlayStation Store pre-orders and purchases had a GTA+ redemption deadline of March 31, 2027 for the complimentary month.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} Xbox-listed pre-orders required purchase prior to 19 November 2026 23:59:59 to receive the Vintage Pack and one month of GTA+.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Physical pre-orders and pre-load

Physical boxes shipped with a download code and included the Vintage Vice City Pack contents in that code.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Digital pre-orders could begin pre-loading Grand Theft Auto VI on November 10, 2026 at midnight local time on PlayStation.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Digital pre-load began November 10, 2026 at 12 a.m. GMT on Xbox.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

