## Overview

Rockstar announced a pre-load newswire titled "Pre-Load Grand Theft Auto VI Now" on November 10, 2026.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Rockstar's November 10 page states pre-loading is now available for everyone who has pre-ordered.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}}

## Platform start times

On PlayStation 5, digital pre-load begins at midnight local time on November 10, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Xbox Wire encouraged players to begin pre-loading as soon as possible due to high demand.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Eligibility and physical codes

Physical copies include a download code and will be available starting November 12 to support pre-loading.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Rockstar states physical codes can be used as soon as received to support pre-load on November 10.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Digital pre-load date

Official sources have given more than one date for when digital pre-loading would begin.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

