## Overview

Lucia’s father taught her to fight as soon as she could walk.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Life has been coming at her swinging ever since.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Prison and Release

Fighting for her family landed her in the Leonida Penitentiary.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Sheer luck got her out of prison.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Fresh out of prison, Lucia is ready to change the odds in her favor.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Ambition and Method

More than anything, Lucia wants the good life her mom dreamed of since their days in Liberty City.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Instead of half-baked fantasies, Lucia is prepared to take matters into her own hands.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Lucia has learned her lesson and intends only smart moves from here.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} She believes the only thing that matters is who you know and what you got.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Connection to Jason Duval

A life with Jason could be her way out.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Meeting Lucia could be the best or worst thing to ever happen to Jason Duval.{{cite:gta6-people-jason}}

