## Background

Cal Hampton is a friend of Jason Duval and a fellow associate of Brian Heder.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}} Cal is described as being at the low tide of America and content there.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}}

## Personality

Cal is characterized as casually paranoid.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}} Casual paranoia is noted to enjoy company, though Jason reportedly has bigger plans.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}}

## Habits and Activities

Cal feels safest staying at home while he snoops on Coast Guard communications.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}} He commonly listens to Coast Guard comms with a few beers and private browser tabs open.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}} Cal remarks about 'too many birds flying around in perfect formation' and that 'the psychopaths are in charge.'{{cite:gta6-people-cal}}

