## Overview

Dre'Quan was described as more of a hustler than a gangster.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Breaking into music was his goal even while dealing on the streets to make ends meet.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Career

He partnered with Boobie Ike through Only Raw Records.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Dancers at Boobie's club served as his informal A&R staff.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} After signing the Real Dimez, his days of booking acts into Boobie's strip club might be numbered.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Notable Signings

Dre'Quan has signed Bae-Luxe and Roxy, known as Real Dimez, to Only Raw Records.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Real Dimez previously had an early hit single with local rapper DWNPLY.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Real Dimez used viral videos and social media to grow their presence.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Ambitions

He is setting his sights on the wider Vice City music scene.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

