## Overview

Raul is a seasoned bank robber.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Experience counts.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Recruitment

He is always on the hunt for talent.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} He looks for people ready to take the risks that bring the biggest rewards.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Personality and Style

Raul displays confidence, charm, and cunning.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} A professional adapts.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Risks and Consequences

Raul's recklessness raises the stakes with every score.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} His crew will have to double down or pull their chips from the table.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

