## Overview

Brian is described as a classic drug runner from the golden age of smuggling in the Keys.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} He has been around long enough to let others do his dirty work.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Brian is said to enjoy a Mudslide at sunset.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Operations

He still moves product through his boat yard with his third wife, Lori.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} He once claimed he hauled so much grass in a plane it could make Leonida levitate.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} He is described as looking like a Leonida beach bum and moving like a great white shark.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Local Ties

Brian is letting Jason live rent-free at one of his properties.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Jason must help with local shakedowns as part of that arrangement.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Jason is also expected to stop by for Lori’s sangria occasionally.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Reputation

Cal and Jason are presented as associates of Brian within the Keys community.{{cite:gta6-people-jason}}

