## Overview

Rockstar calls Vice City "the darkest side of the sunniest place in America."{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Vice City is located within the state of Leonida.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} An extended look and trailers for Grand Theft Auto VI show Vice City footage captured on PlayStation 5.{{cite:playstation-gta6}}

## Role in the Story

Jason and Lucia find themselves in Vice City after a score goes wrong.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} The pair become entangled in a criminal conspiracy stretching across Leonida.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Jason and Lucia are forced to rely on each other to survive that conspiracy.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Lucia is fresh out of prison and committed to changing the odds in her favor.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## People, Businesses, and Culture

Dre'Quan Priest runs Only Raw Records and has signed the Real Dimez.{{cite:gta6-only-in-leonida}} Real Dimez are a duo named Bae-Luxe and Roxy aiming for mainstream success from Vice City's scene.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

