## Overview

The Keys are part of Leonida and are referenced as a location to explore in official Leonida materials.{{cite:gta6-only-in-leonida}}

## Jason Duval in the Keys

Jason Duval grew up around grifters and crooks before joining the Army.{{cite:gta6-people-jason}} After a stint in the Army, Jason found himself in the Keys working for local drug runners.{{cite:gta6-people-jason}} Jason is living rent-free at one of Brian Heder’s properties in the Keys under specific conditions.{{cite:gta6-only-in-leonida}}

## Brian Heder and his operations

Brian Heder is described as a classic drug runner from the golden age of smuggling in the Keys.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Brian still moves product through his boat yard while married to his third wife, Lori.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Brian allows Jason to live rent-free so long as Jason helps with local shakedowns and visits Lori’s sangria sometimes.{{cite:gta6-only-in-leonida}}

## Local connections

Jason is an associate of Brian and is connected to local networks of runners and associates in the Keys.{{cite:gta6-people-cal}}

