## State and principal city

Rockstar's official materials name the game's state as Leonida.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Vice City is featured in Rockstar's official coverage of the game.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

## Named regions and landmarks

Mount Kalaga is listed as a location players can explore.{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Ocean Beach is mentioned in official product copy.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Shore Drive is referenced in official descriptions tied to a vehicle.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Washington Beach is named as a docking location for a specific boat.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Gambit Bay is identified as a place associated with fishing activities.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Watson Bay is named as the site of the Paradise Garage.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} The Paradise Garage in Watson Bay is described as having a weapon locker and a place to fence stolen goods.{{cite:gta6-official-site}}

## How locations appear in official offers

Rockstar's Ultimate Edition product copy ties several named places to exclusive vehicles and items.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} The '95 Grotti Cheetah is described as an ode to Shore Drive in official listings.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} The Shitzu Squalo is described as docked at Washington Beach and linked to Gambit Bay activities in official listings.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

