## Offer

Digital pre-orders and purchases of Grand Theft Auto VI include one month of GTA+ when made before November 20, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Redemption deadlines and platform notes

On PlayStation, the one-month GTA+ can be claimed anytime before March 31, 2027.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} On Xbox, the GTA+ month must be redeemed within 180 days after placing the pre-order.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}} Xbox redemption is not available to child accounts restricted from age-restricted content.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}} Xbox store limits the GTA+ pre-order redemption to one redemption per Platform Account.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Auto-renewal and continuation

PlayStation states the one-month GTA+ subscription auto-renews and continues monthly until canceled.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} PlayStation says the GTA+ subscription is non-transferable and limited to one redemption per account.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

## GTA+ and the Games Library

Take-Two describes the free month of GTA+ as the best way to get the most out of GTA Online.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Take-Two says GTA+ is instantly redeemable to jump into Grand Theft Auto V and other classic Rockstar titles via the GTA+ Games Library.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

