## Redemption Windows

PlayStation requires the GTA+ subscription to be claimed by March 31, 2027 on the account used to pre-order.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} Xbox states the GTA+ month must be redeemed within 180 days after placing the pre-order.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Platform Notes

PlayStation listings indicate Grand Theft Auto VI supports offline play and is for one player.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} Xbox announcement text repeats that Grand Theft Auto VI is a single-player experience and sets the game in Vice City, USA.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

